{"ma_id": "3540268949", "banda": "Abismales", "crv_artist_id": "540", "slug": "abismales", "url": "http://myspace.com/abismales", "archivo_org": "", "ok": true, "snapshot_ts": "20091214012114", "url_snapshot": "https://web.archive.org/web/20091214012114id_/http://www.myspace.com:80/abismales", "fuente": "cdx", "bytes": 115108, "plantilla": "clasica", "titulo": "ABISMALES on MySpace Music - Free Streaming MP3s, Pictures & Music Downloads", "campos": {"Member Since": "8/3/2008", "Band Members": "| \n | \n\n ...FRANK AGUILERA__ BAJO, VOZ \n\n | \n\n | \n\n ...AMILCAR NAVARRO____ GUITARRA,VOZ\n | \n\n | \n ...CRISS GARCíA__BATERIA", "Influences": "Nuestra necesidad de conocimiento estriba en comprender todos aquellos fenómenos sin ilación lógica; lo misterioso, todo lo que conduzca a abrir la secreta puerta de esa infinidad de universos paralelos que aún desconocemos... de eso trata LA MAGIA DEL ABISMO. \n \n \n \n \n \n \n ..", "Type of Label": "Major", "About": "| | \n\n | \n\nABISMALES, nace en la ciudad de Porlamar en octubre de 2007. Fundada por, (Frank Aguilera, bajo y voz; José Maiden Hernandez, bateria; Amilcar Navarro guitarra y voz). Influenciados por el rock de los 60, 70 y el metal de los 80 y 90. Luego de la salida de José Hernandez, baterista original, en 2008 es remplazado por Cristian García, actual baterista de Abismales. \n\n | \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n |"}, "no_ascii": 21, "archivo": "data/raw/myspace-ma-2026-10-15/3540268949-20091214012114.html", "foto_url": "http://c1.ac-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/92/m_54a05d619d4042e1926d8cdb60d5f3c8.gif"}
{"ma_id": "3540275065", "banda": "Intestinal Infection", "crv_artist_id": "822", "slug": "intestinalblasting", "url": "http://myspace.com/intestinalblasting", "archivo_org": "", "ok": true, "snapshot_ts": "20100423013352", "url_snapshot": "https://web.archive.org/web/20100423013352id_/http://www.myspace.com:80/intestinalblasting", "fuente": "cdx", "bytes": 133687, "plantilla": "clasica", "titulo": "Intestinal Infection on MySpace Music - Free Streaming MP3s, Pictures & Music Downloads", "campos": {"Member Since": "12/5/2007", "Band Website": "Coming Soon", "Band Members": "| \n | \n \n | \n | \n \n | \n |", "Influences": "Devourment, Last Days Of Humanity, Internal Suffering, Braindrill, Beneath The Massacre, Pustulated, Katalepsy, Brodequin, Cryptopsy, Deeds Of Flesh, and some other brutal bands...\n\n | \n | \n\n real editor best profile tools real editor best profile tools | | How I made my profile: | I used Dave & Jay's amazing myspace profile editor .", "Record Label": "Extreme Gore Productions", "Type of Label": "Indie", "About": "Español: \n Intestinal Infection fue fundada en Junio del 2007 con la idea original de Andres Lazzari y Javier Diaz de crear música extrema extendiendo los limites de lo físicamente posible en cuanto a velocidad, técnica y brutalidad. Inspirados en bandas de la talla de Devourment, Origin, Deeds Of Flesh, Disgorge, entre muchas otras, salen en busca de músicos con las mismas ideas autodestructivas en cuanto a metal extremo; siendo completada la banda por Diego Ramirez y Daniel Luces, ambos complementando perfectamente el sonido brutal que se buscaba desde un principio. Con esta formación Intestinal Infection se consolida como banda promesa en la escena de metal extremo de Anzoátegui, al debutar en tarima en el 1er aniversario de la Gore/Grind Mafia de Pto La cruz y posteriormente dos presentaciones en la ciudad de El Tigre, seguidas por una pequeña gira de dos ciudades en el país vecino de Colombia con muy buena respuesta de parte del público colombiano. Actualmente se encuentra a la venta su Ep debut titulado \"Internal Deformities\" a travez de Extreme Gore Productions. \n \nFormación actual: | \nDiego Ramirez - Voz | \nAndres Lazzari - Guitarra | \nJavier Diaz - Batería | \n Contactanos por: intestinalinfection_blasting_gore@hotmail.com \n\n English: \n Intestinal Infection was founded in June 2007 with the original idea by Andres Lazzari and Javier Diaz to create Extreme music extending the limits of what's physically possible in terms of speed, technichality and brutality. Inspired from bands like Devourment, Origin, Deeds of Flesh, Disgorge among many others, they begin the search for musicians who share the same autodestructive ideas about extreme metal; the band being completed by Diego Ramirez and Daniel Luces, both perfectly complementing the brutal sound the band was looking for. With this lineup Intestinal Infection is consolidated as a promising band in the extreme metal scene in Anzoategui after having their debut on stage on the 1st Anniversary of the PLC Gore/Grind Mafia and later with two shows in the city of El Tigre, followed by a small two-date tour in the neighbor country of Colombia with a great response from the local audiences. The band's debut Ep titled \"Internal Deformties\" is currently on sale through Extreme Gore Productions \n \nCurrent Lineup: | \nDiego Ramirez - Vocals | \nAndres Lazzari - Guitar | \nJavier Diaz - Drums | \nContact us: intestinalinfection_blasting_gore@hotmail.com \n\n | \n | \n\nINTESTINAL INFECTION \n | \n | \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n | \n     Cheers!! You must be logged in to view this application. | Click here to log into MySpace |"}, "no_ascii": 46, "archivo": "data/raw/myspace-ma-2026-10-15/3540275065-20100423013352.html", "foto_url": "http://c3.ac-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/146/m_8f25708411144d049d4dbc52a435e1be.jpg"}
{"ma_id": "3540276900", "banda": "Sibelius", "crv_artist_id": "445", "slug": "sibeliussoul", "url": "http://myspace.com/sibeliussoul", "archivo_org": "", "ok": true, "snapshot_ts": "20100504043830", "url_snapshot": "https://web.archive.org/web/20100504043830id_/http://www.myspace.com:80/sibeliussoul", "fuente": "cdx", "bytes": 128796, "plantilla": "clasica", "titulo": "SIBELIUS on MySpace Music - Free Streaming MP3s, Pictures & Music Downloads", "campos": {"Member Since": "2/13/2007", "Band Website": "www.sibelius.com.ve", "Band Members": "Philipp K. Scheer & Jorge D. Rojas", "Influences": "| \n\n | \n\n | \n\n | Making Rebellion | \n \n \n \n \n \n | SIBELIUS | MySpace Music Videos \n\n | \n\n | \n\n | \n\n Sibelius in Symphony X concert | \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n | \n\n | \n\n | \n\n | \n\n | \n\n CLICK HERE TO BUY REBELLION ALBUM IN -------------- ITUNES | \n\n | \n\n | \n\n CLICK HERE TO BUY REBELLION ALBUM IN -------------- AMAZON | \n\n | \n\n | \n\n CLICK HERE TO BUY REBELLION ALBUM IN -------------- CDBABY | \n\n | \n\n | \n\n CLICK HERE TO BUY REBELLION ALBUM IN -------------- RHAPSODY | \n\n | \n\n | \n\n CLICK HERE TO BUY REBELLION ALBUM IN -------------- LALA | \n\n | \n\n | \n\n JOIN SIBELIUS IN FACEBOOK RIGHT HERE | \n\n | \n\n | \n\n THE OFFICIAL SIBELIUS WEBSITE RIGHT HERE | \n\n | \n\n | \n\n |", "Sounds Like": "SIBELIUS", "Record Label": "unsigned", "Type of Label": "Major", "About": "b> | \n\n | \n\n | \n\nBIOGRAFIA DE SIBELIUS\n\n | \n\n | \n\nSibelius es un proyecto venezolano con tendencia neoclásica instrumental creado en\nel 2004, por Philipp K. Scheer catalogado como “la nueva guitarra venezolana” y el\nmulti-instrumentista Jorge D. Rojas. Ellos, además de amor a la música, tienen\nescuela, formación académica y mucho recorrido en otras agrupaciones.\n\n | \n\n | \n\nSu primer álbum “Rebellion”, fue grabado en gran parte en Venezuela, y la\nsonorización orquestal fue realizada en España, por Eduardo de la Iglesia, quien ha\ntrabajado en docenas de producciones como Commandos 2, Commandos 3 para Pc,\nXbox y Playstation2, PCfútbol 2007 y ganador del concurso de composición musical\nMIDI de la Revista PCMania.\n\n | \n\n | \n\nLa mezcla y masterización fue realizada en Los Ángeles California por el reconocido\ningeniero de sonido con más de treinta años de experiencia Michael Vail Blum;\nquien ha grabado, mezclado y masterizado a artistas reconocidos mundialmente como\nMadonna, Goo Goo Dolls, Jordan Julian Lennon, Suicidal Tendencies, Brian Ferry,\nMarilyn Martin, Kenny Loggins, entre muchos otros\n\n | \n\n | \n\nSu primer álbum “Rebellion” ha generado altas expectativas nacionales e\ninternacionales, lo que le ha permitido colocarse en Itunes, Amazon, Napster,\nBuyMusic, Rhapsody, MusicIsHere, Cdbaby, entre muchas otras tiendas digitales.\nEsto sin incluir la presencia en la gran mayoría de tiendas venezolanas y ventas en\nUSA, Grecia, India y Japón.\n\n | \n\n | \n\n1.000 (Mil) copias vendidas de su primer álbum en 5 (cinco) meses.\n\n | \n\n | \n\n | \n\n | \n\nSIBELIUS BIOGRAPHY\n\n | \n\n | \n\nSIBELIUS is a Venezuelan Project. Founded in 2004, fundamentally based on instrumental neo-classic musical tendencies. Philipp Scheer, its founder and the Group’s Guitar, belonged and received classic musical instruction at a very early stage of his life.\n\n | \n\n | \n\nPhilipp decides to study and specialize in Violin, but a severe wrist fracture at the age of sixteen definitely disables him to continue with such plans. Quite frustrated at the turn of events, he however decides to continue with his commitment to the world of music by studying Drums for a number of years, playing with diverse bands which led him to incur and become knowledgeable about non classical music. As time passes, Philipp experiences the great need to return to strings, he begins composing and takes up other instruments, finally choosing the electrical guitar as his favorite. The Guitar allows him to apply all he has studied in violin but with a conjunct versatility found in Drums.\n\n | \n\n | \n\nProfound studies, techniques and exercises practiced in violin render it easier to apply and play the Electrical Guitar. Also, thanks to the musical experience with other instruments ,performances at concerts, for example in Mexico, chamber music, philharmonic orchestras, participation in events with diverse number of groups….,render the birth of an IDEA … To CONCENTRATE all of the above INTO ONE, by joining and integrating\nClassic mu"}, "no_ascii": 75, "archivo": "data/raw/myspace-ma-2026-10-15/3540276900-20100504043830.html", "foto_url": "http://c4.ac-images.myspacecdn.com/images01/55/m_3ec67f135680ab18d669e60fd2dec4ab.jpg"}
