{"ma_id": "3540304925", "banda": "Forgotten Moon", "crv_artist_id": "861", "slug": "forgottenmoonvzla", "url": "http://myspace.com/forgottenmoonvzla", "archivo_org": "", "ok": true, "snapshot_ts": "20090211063649", "url_snapshot": "https://web.archive.org/web/20090211063649id_/http://www.myspace.com:80/forgottenmoonvzla", "fuente": "cdx", "bytes": 155000, "plantilla": "clasica", "titulo": "Forgotten Moon on MySpace Music - Free Streaming MP3s, Pictures & Music Downloads", "campos": {"Member Since": "6/28/2008", "Band Members": "Recording: M.O. a.k.a. B.Vrolok W.M. (All the voices, instruments, synths, and ambients)\n\nLive: Other people", "Influences": "Musically: Black Metal: Raw, Ambient, Depressive, Pagan, Folk, some stuff from n.s. ideology\n____________________________________________________________________\nEnviroments: Rains, Fog, Forest, Snow, Winter, Cold, Blizzards, Darkness, Suffering, Hatred.\n____________________________________________________________________\nSome Bands that influenced me: Forest of Fog, Burzum, Darkthrone, Aldaaron, Belenos, Pagan Spirit, Bornholm, Seigneur Voland, Graveland, Nokturnal Mortum, Taake, Pest, Peste Noire, Satanic Warmaster, Abyssic Hate, and fucking more!", "Record Label": "Looking for a Label / En busca", "About": "{} \n \n \n \n \n \n \n .. \n | | Myspace Layout Generator by LayoutGeneratorMyspace.com | | \n\nProyecto Black Metal surgido al mando de BM B.Vrolok W.M. en 2008. Es un Black Metal muy ligado a la influencia Raw, Depressive, Ambient y Pagan Black Metal. Este proyecto se ha realizado para autodisfrute del mismo y disfrute de los Hermanos BM. No jodan. Si no les agrada largense. No estoy aquí para satisfacerlos.\n\n__________________________________________________________________\nBlack Metal proyect emerged at the helm of BM B.Vrolok W.M. in 2008. Is a Black Metal very bound to influence of Raw, Depressive, Ambient and Pagan Black Metal. This proyect was carried out to my enjoyment of it and the enjoyment of all the BM Brothers. Don't fuck it!, if you don't like this just fuck off!!! I'm not in here to give you happiness.\n\n__________________________________________________________________\nThe Fortress of Frozen Bones (Demo I) Free download link: \nhttp://rapidshare.com/files/169705296/The_Fortress_of_Frozen_Bones__Demo_I_.rar\n\nAtt. BM B.Vrolok W.M.\n \n \n \n \n \n \n |"}, "no_ascii": 48, "archivo": "data/raw/myspace-ma-2026-10-15/3540304925-20090211063649.html", "foto_url": "http://c3.ac-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/18/m_d79255a173db4c9abbc5ef2fde52fa9e.jpg"}
{"ma_id": "3540304925", "banda": "Forgotten Moon", "crv_artist_id": "861", "slug": "depressiveillusions", "url": "http://myspace.com/depressiveillusions", "archivo_org": "", "ok": true, "snapshot_ts": "20100228182254", "url_snapshot": "https://web.archive.org/web/20100228182254id_/http://www.myspace.com:80/depressiveillusions", "fuente": "cdx", "bytes": 88175, "plantilla": "clasica", "titulo": "Depressive Illusions Records on MySpace Music - Free Streaming MP3s, Pictures & Music Downloads", "campos": {"Member Since": "9/17/2009", "Type of Label": "Unsigned", "About": "Depressive Illusions are a small label oriented on released black metal, dark ambient, harsh noise, drone ambient, funeral doom ets. All releases are very limited edition. \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \ncut 001: WINTER DEPRESSION \"..your weary eyes..\"\n \nfull-length 2009 TAPE in special package Lmt.33\n \nFirst album of this Atmospheric Black Metal project from Ukraine.\n \n \n \n \ncut 002: NECROSADIK \"21 years of self-destruction and mass murder\"\n \nbest of../comp. 2009 TAPE Lmt.111\n \n15 tracks of Sick Black Poison from Mexico.\n \n \n \n \n \ncut 003: DEVIATOR \"Estrangement\" Demo 2008\n \nTAPE in special package Lmt.50\n \n8 tracks of Dak Ambient demo of this band from Ukraine. Re-edition of demo 2008.\n \n \n \n \n \ncut 005: WINTER DEPRESSION \"Misanthropy\"\n \nfull-length 2009 TAPE Lmt.66\n \n8 tracks of Atmospheric Black Metal from Ukraine. Begotten member.\n \n \n \n \n \ncut 006: BEGOTTEN \"Where the sun goes down..\"\n \nfull-length 2009 TAPE Lmt.88\n \n8 tracks of Atmospheric Raw Black Metal from Ukraine.\n \n \n \n \n \ncut 007: ZARACH BAAL THARAGH / WINTER DEPRESSION \n \n\"Atumnal melancholie\" split TAPE Lmt.66\n \n1 Sick Primitive Black Metal poison from France & 5 tracks of Cold Atmospheric Black Metal from Ukraine\n \n \n \n \n \ncut 008: RUINAERUS \"Lifeless\" EP 2009 TAPE Lmt.33\n \nCold Atmospheric Black Metal from Austria. 1 long track\n \n \n \n \n \ncut 009: WINTER DEPRESSION \"Ode to Sorrow\" full-length 2009 \n \nTAPE Lmt.66\n \n9 Dark Ambint tracks of this Ukrainian project (Begotten member).\n \n \n \n \n \n \ncut 010: UNENDING HATRED \"Emptiness Cold\" demo 2009\n \nTAPE Lmt.66\n \n(2 versions of cover Art, each limited in 33 copies!!)\n \nRaw Deprssive Black Metal in unique way from Mexico.\n \n \n \n \n \ncut 011: LEICHENSTÄTTE \"Das finstere Irrlicht\" EP 2009 TAPE Lmt.66\n \n1 long track of Raw Depressive Black Metal from Germany.\n \n\n \n \n \n \ncut 013: TODESSUCHT \"Wo Einsamkeit ist...\" Demo 2009\n \nTAPE Lmt.66\n \n2 tracks of Raw Depressive Black Metal from Germany.\n \n\n \n \n \n \ncut 014: ANIMA INFERNALIS \"Depressed with myself\" Demo 2009\n \nTAPE Lmt.66\n \nRaw Depressive Black Metal from Italy. 5 tracks\n \n \n\n \n \n \ncut 015: ANIMA INFERNALIS \"Walk In The Perdition Of A Lost World\" \n \nfull-length 2009\n \nTAPE Lmt.66\n \nLong time unreleased album of this RawBlack Metal band from Italy. 10 tracks + intro/outro\n \n \n\n \n \n \ncut 016: LYCANTHROPY \"Десница Тьмы\" full-length 2009\n \nTAPE Lmt.66\n \nCold Black Metal from Russia. 7 tracks + Mayhem cover\n \n \n\n \n \n \ncut 017: SATURN FORM ESSENCE \"Galaxy M31: Andromeda\" EP 2010\n \nSpecial black box with tape, 5 pins ets.. Lmt. 9\n \nCosmic Drone Noise of this Ukrainian project\n \n \n\n \n \n \ncut 018: LYCANTHROPY \"Black christmas\" full-length 2008\n \nTAPE Lmt.66\n \nCold Black Metal from Russia. 8 tracks + Lucifugum cover\n \n \n\n \n \n \ncut 019: LYCANTHROPY \"Cerberus warewolfs\" EP 2009 TAPE Lmt.66\n \nCod Black Metal from Russia. 4 tracks.\n \n \n\n \n \n \ncut 020: NIHILIA \"Zpustoseni\" Demo 2008 TAPE Lmt.66\n \nCold primitive Dark Ambient project from Mexico. 1 track + into. This demo 2008 now released.\n \n \n\n \n \n \ncut 021: NECROLUST \"Cl"}, "no_ascii": 16, "archivo": "data/raw/myspace-ma-2026-10-15/3540304925-20100228182254.html", "foto_url": "http://c2.ac-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/42/m_dbfefc893aac4d6188127d55e9941b6d.gif"}
