{"ma_id": "3540378368", "banda": "Laberinto", "crv_artist_id": "141", "slug": "laberintomusic", "url": "https://myspace.com/laberintomusic", "archivo_org": "", "ok": true, "snapshot_ts": "20091018122350", "url_snapshot": "https://web.archive.org/web/20091018122350id_/http://www.myspace.com:80/laberintomusic", "fuente": "cdx", "bytes": 122790, "plantilla": "clasica", "titulo": "LABERINTO on MySpace Music - Free Streaming MP3s, Pictures & Music Downloads", "campos": {"Member Since": "7/2/2009", "Band Website": "NEW OFFICIAL WEBSITE! laberintomusic.com", "Band Members": "| \n\n Ronny Tuinman - Vocals | \n_____________ | \n | \n\n Abel Canizales - Guitar, backing vocals | \n_____________ | \n | \n\n Marco Toro - Drums, Percussion | \n_____________ | \n | \n\n Gregorio - Bass, backing vocals | \n_____________ | \n \n\n Miguel Padron - Percussion | \n\n_____________ |", "Type of Label": "Unsigned", "About": "LABERINTO is powered by | \n \n\n ____________ | \n\n LINKS | \n\n OFFICIAL LABERINTO WEBSITE! | | \n\n LABERINTO YOU TUBE | | \n\n LABERINTOMETALATINO MYSPACE en español | | \n\n LABERINTO TWITTER | | \n\n LABERINTO HYVES | | \n\n LABERINTO FACEBOOK | | \n\n JIC MUSIC | \n\n ____________ | \n\nLABERINTO's most recent album, MASK OF A THOUSAND FACES (recorded in 2009) has been pre-produced in EXCESS STUDIOS in Rottedam and it has been mixed and mastered in Miami - US by ALEX GARCIA and BOB ST. JOHN (engineer and producer for artists such as DURAN DURAN, EXTREME and COLLECTIVE SOUL). CD available soon!\n\n ____________ | \n\nLABERINTO was born in Caracas – Venezuela in 1989 as a powerful and energetic Metal band incorporating traditional Afro-Caribbean instruments to their songs. This chemistry lead to a whole new musical mixture which brought Laberinto’s Metalatino trademark sound into existence. | \n\nThe band moved their home base to Amsterdam in 1992 surprising the European music scene with their revolutionary fusion of multi-cultural percussion with high quality Hardcore Metal. | \n\nSome highlights in their career are the ISLAND MUSIC Festival (Hungary); WACKEN OPEN AIR Festival, WDR ROCKPALAST (Germany); BOREC TRINEC Festival (Czech Republic); ROCK AL PARQUE (Colombia); ALEN GALICIA Festival (Spain); DYNAMO OPEN AIR, NJOY FESTIVAL (Holland) and TV and Radio specials in Germany, Venezuela and The Netherlands. | \n\nThey have shared stage with famous bands like MARILYN MANSON, CRADLE OF FILTH, TESTAMENT, HELMET, TIAMAT, MACHINE HEAD, SICK OF IT ALL, EXODUS, THE OFFSPRING, MOONSPELL, NAPALM DEATH, LIMP BIZKIT and KORN. | \n\nLABERINTO has released the albums \"LABERINTO\" (1995), \"PRIORITY\" (1996), \"FREAKEAO\" (1998), “LABERINTO LIVE\" (2000), \"ANOTHER STYLE\" (also 2000, produced by Attie Bauw - Scorpions, Judas Priest, The Gathering), “DECADA\" (2003) and “THE WORLD MIGHT SUCK – LABERINTO FEATURING OSDORP POSSE” (2008) which includes the bonus DVD \"MI ARTE: 15 YEARS OF LABERINTO\", with more than an hour of history spanning Laberinto's career, complete videography, live tour clips, TV specials, pictures and a comprehensive interview with the band members.\n\n ____________ | \n\nVisit www.laberintomusic.com for a complete bio, | pictures, video clips, sounds and more!\n\n ____________ | \n\nFor management and booking information contact: | \nMarc Walboomers | \nmarc@walboomers.com | | \n | \n\n ____________ | \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n | \n\nLABERINTO LIVE : SMART ASS\n\n ____________ | \n\n DISCOGRAPHY | \n \n\n ____________ | \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n .. \n | \n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n | \n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n | \n \n \n | \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n |"}, "no_ascii": 26, "archivo": "data/raw/myspace-ma-2026-10-15/3540378368-20091018122350.html", "foto_url": "http://c1.ac-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/77/m_97dfcd807ffa4b95befe1bea121b90f4.jpg"}
