{"ma_id": "3540426396", "banda": "Etixakkh", "crv_artist_id": null, "slug": "etixakkh", "url": "https://myspace.com/etixakkh", "archivo_org": "", "ok": true, "snapshot_ts": "20090322222448", "url_snapshot": "https://web.archive.org/web/20090322222448id_/http://www.myspace.com:80/etixakkh", "fuente": "cdx", "bytes": 55192, "plantilla": "clasica", "titulo": "EtixakkH on MySpace Music - Free Streaming MP3s, Pictures & Music Downloads", "campos": {"Member Since": "1/14/2009", "Band Members": "V.R XV: All Fuck off", "Influences": "Poems,True Devil Worship, mlo and kvlt's..", "Sounds Like": "true black metal no school", "Type of Label": "Unsigned", "About": "etixakkh not is a black metal for humans or \"true black metal posers\", etixakkh is a only a simple black metal without work, in this myspace upload only sample for complete work or music CONTACT US!! FUCK OFF!!\n | \nAntiposer Black Metal From Venezuela, Fuck off the scene, fuck off the world, fuck off the fucking black metaller of only music, black metal not is music, black metal no school since all, fuck off the \" false black metal\" venezuelan \"proyect\" \"depressive people\" haha fuck onegayman 2008/7, fuck off this universe, fuck off all fuck off etixakkh\n\nFuck you All, Cosmic Destruction\n | \n(218)\n\n | \n \n \n \n \n \n \n |"}, "no_ascii": 1, "archivo": "data/raw/myspace-ma-2026-10-15/3540426396-20090322222448.html", "foto_url": "http://c1.ac-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/50/m_c100be8400944ff8be7006638cda2a28.jpg"}
