{"ma_id": "3540443424", "banda": "Aluvion", "crv_artist_id": null, "slug": "aluvion", "url": "https://myspace.com/aluvion", "archivo_org": "", "ok": true, "snapshot_ts": "20090125025314", "url_snapshot": "https://web.archive.org/web/20090125025314id_/http://www.myspace.com:80/aluvion", "fuente": "cdx", "bytes": 74657, "plantilla": "clasica", "titulo": "ALUVION on MySpace Music - Free Streaming MP3s, Pictures & Music Downloads", "campos": {"Member Since": "6/30/2008", "Band Members": "Título \n \n \n\n__________________________________________\n\n__________________________________________\n\n \n \n\n \n\n \n \n Título \n \n \n\n__________________________________________\n\nPROXIMOS EVENTOS.....\n__________________________________________", "Type of Label": "Unsigned", "About": ".. \n \n \n \n \n \n \n .. | \n\n \n \n Título \n \n \n\n_________________________________________________________________\n\nGRAN NOCHE DE METAL DE FIN DE AÑO\n\n_________________________________________________________________\n_________________________________________________________________\n\n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n Título \n \n \n\n_________________________________________________________________\n\nALUVION (BIOGRAFIA)\n\n_________________________________________________________________\n_________________________________________________________________\n\n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n Título \n \n \n\n_________________________________________________________________\n\nPRE GILLMANFEST ABRIL 13, 2008\n\n_________________________________________________________________\n_________________________________________________________________\n\n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n Título \n \n \n\n_________________________________________________________________\n\nPRE GILLMANFEST ABRIL 13, 2008\n\n_________________________________________________________________\n_________________________________________________________________\n\n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n\