{"ma_id": "96433", "banda": "Veniath", "crv_artist_id": null, "slug": "veniath", "url": "http://myspace.com/veniath", "archivo_org": "", "ok": true, "snapshot_ts": "20100404121038", "url_snapshot": "https://web.archive.org/web/20100404121038id_/http://www.myspace.com/veniath", "fuente": "cdx", "bytes": 104395, "plantilla": "clasica", "titulo": "Veniath on MySpace Music - Free Streaming MP3s, Pictures & Music Downloads", "campos": {"Member Since": "4/3/2006", "Band Website": "http://www.veniath.com", "Band Members": "Susana Gonzalez - voz | \nJesus Marcano - guitarra | \nChristian Sucre - guitarra | \nJosé 'gigi' Irigoyen - bajo | \nEnzo Khayat - bateria", "Influences": "Death, Morbid Angel, Kreator, Possesed, Behemoth, Obituary", "Sounds Like": "Old School Death Metal", "Type of Label": "Major", "About": "| | \n Nuestro Demo de 4 canciones 'Fight Against your Mind' a la Venta en: | | \n*Barcelona: Metallium (Boulevard 5 de Julio, C.C. Unico, 1º piso) | \n*Lechería: Advertencia (C.C. Plaza Mayor, Galería Caribana) | \n*Puerto Ordaz: Cresta Metálica (C.C. Ciudad Alta Vista. Piso 2, Local 112. | Al lado de Start World) | \n*Caracas: Melomaniac (C.C. Doral, detrás de Beco. Nivel Mezzanina, | local 62. Chacaíto) | \n...y a través de nuestro e-mail: veniath-vzla@hotmail.com | | \nTracklist: | \n1- Only Flesh | \n2- Taste the Tears | \n3- Fight Against your Mind | \n4- Live Through Lies | \n | Apoyemos al Metal Nacional!\n | | \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n |"}, "no_ascii": 43, "archivo": "data/raw/myspace-ma-2026-10-15/96433-20100404121038.html", "foto_url": "http://c1.ac-images.myspacecdn.com/images01/85/m_2f34b0e079e4835a0976f96e7f24a8d4.jpg"}
