ground-color:rgb(0,0,0); \nopacity:0.8; \n-moz-opacity:0.8; \nfilter:alpha(opacity=80); \n} \n\ntable table table table, div table table table{ \nborder-style:none; \n} \n\nA IMG{ \nborder-style:none; \n} \na I edited my profile with Thomas' Myspace Editor V4.4 \n\n.. --> --> Unete en Nuestro MSN Grupos -->\n \n \n \n     Unirse a Inulina puro rock hecho en barinas \n     \n \n \n \n  MSN Grupos \n \n \n \n.. --> --> Resibiras toda las noticias a tu correo-->", "Similaire à": ".. width=\"425\" height=\"350\"> \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n ..>", "Type de label": "Aucun"}, "no_ascii": 143, "archivo": "data/raw/myspace-ma-2026-10-15/99902-20071014213123.html", "foto_url": "http://a251.ac-images.myspacecdn.com/images01/38/m_a4e0570f536bd5966abed808a0ab063a.gif"}
{"ma_id": "105375", "banda": "Lessthanot", "crv_artist_id": "848", "slug": "", "url": "", "archivo_org": "https://web.archive.org/web/20090222124900/https://myspace.com/lessthanot", "ok": true, "snapshot_ts": "20090222124900", "url_snapshot": "https://web.archive.org/web/20090222124900id_/https://myspace.com/lessthanot", "fuente": "ma", "bytes": 193654, "plantilla": "clasica", "titulo": "Lessthanot on MySpace Music - Free Streaming MP3s, Pictures & Music Downloads", "campos": {"Member Since": "12/28/2006", "Band Website": "Under Contruction / En construcción", "Record Label": "Unsigned", "About": "| \n \n LESSTHANOT begins in 2004 \n as a project between Marco Velazco (lead guitar and vocals) \n and Omar Hernandez (drums), with the willing to form an \n extreme metal band inspired by death metal , both, the melodic and \n the pure. Since their origins they dedicated to rehearse opposed genre band \n covers, like Metallica , and forward time, to start writing \n some own songs. In that moment, they were done with their first song; wich \n was named \"A Letter to My God\" . | \n | \n Later on, Alejandro Coronel (bass) and Angel Duarte \n (rhythm guitar) joined the band, completing their first alignment and giving \n birth to the band name: A three word mix that remembered them their beginnings \n and the people who believed in them since the early days: \"Less Than Nothing\", \n wich was later narrowed down to Lessthanot . Later that year\n Lessthanot had its first live show, with only two months \n of existence, at the Pablo Castellano Music School in Vargas, Venezuela.\n | \n | \n At the beginning of 2005, they started to work on new songs: \"Lessthanot\" ,\n \"Insurrección\" and \"Angels' Tears\" came out. In March \n of the same year, the band recorded the single for this last stated song, \n wich allowed the band to perform live again, this time, at the Complejo \n Cultural Jose Maria Vargas, where they had great acceptation. Later on, \n the band wanted to define more their musical style and sound, so they choosed \n to add keyboard, Jessica Sakumoto took the seat. | \n | \n At the end of year and due to a few live shows, as well as the great receptiveness \n of the public, Lessthanot is invited to a private show, \n and shared stage with three big national bands Extremo Sur ,\n Tinieblas and Natastor . | \n | \n During 2006, Marco Velazco takes an important decision \n about the alignment of the band. To write more complex guitar riffs, he \n decides to leave the vocals and take care of the lead guitar duties and \n chorus vocals only, due to that, Christian Moreno enters \n in the band as lead vocalist. After this change the song “ Doomsday \" \n came out, wich received very good critics. | \n | \n Months later, guitar player Angel Duarte quits the band, \n and then Jorge Galindo joins in, who also played in the \n band named Pray . At the same time, Jessica Sakumoto \n quits the band because many musical differences and the band decided to \n try luck without this instrument. Later, they managed to record their first \n demo Doomsday , wich helped the band grew up into the national scene \n and getting many shows in different locations around the country, sharing \n stage with bands like Natastor , Torre de Marfíl , \n Grand Bite , and many others. Ending this year they were interviewed \n two times by Kultura Rock Radio show, directed by venezuelan singer,\n Paul Gillman . | \n | \n In 2007, Lessthanot announced that Jorge Galindo \n leaves the band, and so on, young guitar player Valdemar Mendez \n joins in. | \n | \n Actually the band is promoting their independent debut Extended Play , \n entitl"}, "no_ascii": 94, "archivo": "data/raw/myspace-ma-2026-10-15/105375-20090222124900.html", "foto_url": "http://c4.ac-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/42/m_dac2b9009cae4e63b844a09d24b3d327.gif"}
{"ma_id": "10877", "banda": "Resistencia", "crv_artist_id": "210", "slug": "", "url": "", "archivo_org": "https://web.archive.org/web/20090204104237/https://myspace.com/resistencia1980s", "ok": true, "snapshot_ts": "20090204104237", "url_snapshot": "https://web.archive.org/web/20090204104237id_/https://myspace.com/resistencia1980s", "fuente": "ma", "bytes": 169582, "plantilla": "clasica", "titulo": "Resistencia 1980 - 1989 on MySpace Music - Free Streaming MP3s, Pictures & Music Downloads", "campos": {"Member Since": "10/1/2006", "Band Website": "debesresistir.com", "Band Members": "| \n\n | \nCésar Somoza: voz (1977-1989) | \n\nRicardo Escobar: batería (1977-1989) | \n\nMarco Ciargo: guitarra (1980-1989) | \n\nLuís Panero: bajo (1982-1987) (1989) | \n\nRodrigo Yoma (QEPD 1960-2007): guitarra (1980-1984) | \n\nVíctor Lopez: bajo (1980-1982) | \n\nFernando Aponte: teclados (1987) | \n\nVíctor Fiol: bajo (1987) | \n |", "Influences": "| \n | \n | \nHecho en Venezuela 1981 | \n | \n\n | \nEstrategia contra el movimiento 1983 | \n | \n | \nDaCapo 1984 | \n | \n | \nDemo - Zodiaco 1985", "Sounds Like": "| \nRESISTENCIA | \n | \n |", "Record Label": "Color (1981-1984)", "About": "El Nacional Viernes 10 de Septiembre de 1982\n | | \nLa mayoría de los interpretes de música rock en nuestro país se inscriben dentro del estilo conocido popularmente como heavy metal, expresión extraída de algunos pasajes de la novela de William Burroughs “Naked Lunch” ( Almuerzo Desnudo ). Este fenómeno es perfectamente inteligible una vez que reconocemos que el rock en su variante heavy metal es producto principalmente del origen casi absolutamente urbano de esta forma musical pesada e indolente sustentada sólidamente en el usufructo de una tecnología primaria que convive insana y perfectamente con la contaminación sonora y el concreto armado. Las limitaciones formales y las contradicciones conceptuales del heavy metal están presentes en la mayoría de nuestras bandas metalúrgicas ( Arkangel, Chesse Factory, Alta Frecuencia, Sassy, Fahrenheit ), pero difícilmente encontraremos en la escena rock local un grupo que las asuma con la dignidad y la gracia de Resistencia.\n | | \nLas composiciones de Resistencia están estructuradas alrededor de una sección rítmica bien consolidada aunque abrupta, barroca que contrasta con el lirismo inmaculado de algunos pasajes instrumentales en los cuáles el virtuosismo en la ejecución de las guitarras eléctricas denota la presencia de atributos artísticos raramente evidenciables entre nuestros cultores del heavy metal.\n | | \nLas aptitudes de Resistencia no son meramente formales aunque éstas merecen ser destacadas por la condición de autodidactas de los integrantes del grupo, sino que poseen la cualidad adicional y trascendental de que a través de sus canciones intentan trasmitir un mensaje de crítica social y existencial que los hace excepcionales dentro de una corriente musical caracterizada por la pobreza ideológica y la agresividad estéril.\n | | \nResistencia está lejos de ser una banda contestataria o subversiva, el rock n’ roll está condicionado por el mercado y los medio de difusión, pero al ofrecer su propia óptica sobre lo que representa su responsabilidad de artista comprometido en medio de un contexto social opresivo y castrador hacen honor a su nombre y se erigen expresándose a sí mismos a través de una música de gran fortaleza y originalidad que se resiste a ser subordinada a la categoría de simple entretenimiento. Aunque conceptualmente la filosofía de cambio del grupo es un tanto mística, parte de la introspección, de la búsqueda de la verdad, del individuo, el simple hecho de que hay una intención revelatoria y una motivación participativa nos lleva a concluir que el grupo de rock Resistencia es sencillamente único.\n | | \nLa banda está integrada por César Somoza ( vocalista ), Marco Ciargo y Rodrigo Yoma ( guitarristas ), Ricardo Escobar (percusionista) y Luís Panero ( bajista ), y han grabado un solo longplay “Hecho en Venezuela “ de tres previstos en un contrato rescindido de mutuo acuerdo una vez que la discográfica pretendió condicionar y limitar las composiciones de Resistencia a un sonido comercia"}, "no_ascii": 119, "archivo": "data/raw/myspace-ma-2026-10-15/10877-20090204104237.html", "foto_url": "http://c3.ac-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/9/m_8ee85536f0394bd2abe24a24e48faaca.jpg"}
{"ma_id": "118570", "banda": "Avathar", "crv_artist_id": "954", "slug": "", "url": "", "archivo_org": "https://web.archive.org/web/20070302202743/https://myspace.com/avatharweb", "ok": true, "snapshot_ts": "20070302202743", "url_snapshot": "https://web.archive.org/web/20070302202743id_/https://myspace.com/avatharweb", "fuente": "ma", "bytes": 150251, "plantilla": "clasica", "titulo": "www.myspace.com/avatharweb", "campos": {"Member Since": "9/2/2005", "Band Website": "avathar.tk", "Influences": "Death, iron maiden, helloween, blind guardian, torre de marfil, kreator, testament, ramones, at the gates, ratos de porao, sepultura, gamma ray, trivium, sentenced, machine head, radiohead, la iguana, judas priest,dream theater, ark, gorefest, Rage, anthrax, annihilator, motorhead, Bruce Dickinson, Skid Row, AC/DC, Judas Priest, slayer, pantera, megadeth, etc", "Sounds Like": "la lluvia en tu techo cuando se va la luz", "Type of Label": "None", "About": "Avathar started back in 2003 in Ciudad Ojeda, Venezuela (South America) with the idea of create heavy metal music influenced by the great bands of the 80`s and the 90`s we have an old demo (2003-2004) with a different line up of the band, right now we are currently recording our first album if u want to buy a demo or the new album when its finished write us... Rock!!! \n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nAvathar empezo a principios del 2003 con la idea de hacer heavy metal influenciado por las grandes bandas de los 80s y 90s... Tenemos un demo del (2003-2004). Despues de algunos cambios en la formacion de la banda, actualmente se esta grabando lo que sera el 1er disco de la banda.\n\nEstamos radicados en Ciudad Ojeda, Edo Zulia - Venezuela... \n\n Rock!\n MyGen Profile Generator \n\n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n |"}, "no_ascii": 10, "archivo": "data/raw/myspace-ma-2026-10-15/118570-20070302202743.html", "foto_url": "http://a520.ac-images.myspacecdn.com/images01/64/m_2e8c580a6d009e574c86644b13e55a57.jpg"}
{"ma_id": "122570", "banda": "Up the Terror", "crv_artist_id": "762", "slug": "", "url": "", "archivo_org": "https://web.archive.org/web/20100109212147/https://myspace.com/uptheterror", "ok": true, "snapshot_ts": "20100109212147", "url_snapshot": "https://web.archive.org/web/20100109212147id_/https://myspace.com/uptheterror", "fuente": "ma", "bytes": 156419, "plantilla": "clasica", "titulo": "UP THE TERROR nuevos temas on MySpace Music - Free Streaming MP3s, Pictures & Music Downloads", "campos": {"Member Since": "11/28/2007", "Band Members": "JEAN PAUL CLARAC - VOCAL / GUITARRA\n\n \nRAFAEL ALEMÁN - GUITARRA LIDER\n\n \nANGEL PEPERONI - BAJO\n\n \nLEO GUERCIO - BATERÍA", "Influences": "death, slayer, exodus, kreator, violator, tankard, megadeth old , metallica old, anthrax, nemesis, sodom, forbidden, testament, rock and roll \"70\", municipal waste, vio-lence, hard-core, s.o.d., d.r.i. , m.o.d., speed metal, motorhead ......etc", "Sounds Like": "UP THE TERROR", "Record Label": "Demo Kill the monkey, EP Lord Of Destruction", "About": "| | \n \n Up the terror \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n | \n     Movies | |"}, "no_ascii": 48, "archivo": "data/raw/myspace-ma-2026-10-15/122570-20100109212147.html", "foto_url": "http://c3.ac-images.myspacecdn.com/images01/26/m_9644e605a1beb482ed5b49189af87e7a.jpg"}
{"ma_id": "126735", "banda": "Raw Oath", "crv_artist_id": "415", "slug": "", "url": "", "archivo_org": "https://web.archive.org/web/20090214152534/https://myspace.com/rawoath", "ok": true, "snapshot_ts": "20090214152534", "url_snapshot": "https://web.archive.org/web/20090214152534id_/https://myspace.com/rawoath", "fuente": "ma", "bytes": 110375, "plantilla": "clasica", "titulo": "Raw Oath on MySpace Music - Free Streaming MP3s, Pictures & Music Downloads", "campos": {"Member Since": "1/13/2008", "Band Members": "Peter k A.kA a.e.w. i.t.v.r :All", "Influences": "worship satan |", "Record Label": "P.Asgeroth Black Label Venezuela", "About": "Proyect OF Peter k(Zatrarath,Wertimavet(r.i.p),wisethrone(r.i.p),Kill,elixath,wertimavet(in hold)) First Fucking Proyect Of Black Metal Noise From Venezuela, Born In 2004 Fuck you All\n | \nDiscography:\n | Demo 1 the unknown 2004/05\n | Demo 2 fuck off raw oath is real 2006\n | Demo 3 Black Noise Suicide(Venezuelan Hell Noise ritual)Cd Rom 2007\n | Single Antihuman Holocaust 2008\n | Split Zebra mu / Raw Oath 2008 \n | Demo 4 March Of Death 2008\n | Demo 5 Apocalizum Orthodox Noizze 2008\n | Demo 6 SSatanic Kampf 2008\n | Split Zbt / Raw Oath - N.S.T.M & Misanthropic's Ritual's 2008\n | Demo 7 - Madness\n | Demo 8 - VIII\n | Demo 9 - Kvlt\n | Demo 10 - O.D.W\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n |"}, "no_ascii": 2, "archivo": "data/raw/myspace-ma-2026-10-15/126735-20090214152534.html", "foto_url": "http://c4.ac-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/18/m_ae6f990d32914dbeac39126b4832084b.jpg"}
{"ma_id": "14251", "banda": "Slow Death", "crv_artist_id": "752", "slug": "", "url": "", "archivo_org": "https://web.archive.org/web/20090203150346/http://www.myspace.com/slowdeathband", "ok": true, "snapshot_ts": "20090203150346", "url_snapshot": "https://web.archive.org/web/20090203150346id_/http://www.myspace.com/slowdeathband", "fuente": "ma", "bytes": 162132, "plantilla": "clasica", "titulo": "Slow Death - Nuevo Tema on MySpace Music - Free Streaming MP3s, Pictures & Music Downloads", "campos": {"Member Since": "5/30/2005", "Band Website": "myspace.com/slowdeathband", "Band Members": "Antonio Rodriguez:Guitarra, Carlos Sanchez: Voz, Asdrubal Colina: Bajo.", "Record Label": "Melomaniac Records (Venezuela)", "Type of Label": "Indie", "About": ".. Death Metal Venezuelan band, formed in 1996 by Antonio Rodriguez and Jorge Gutierrez. 1 demo, 1 independet release, and two signed records one with Venezuelan record label Melomaniac Records and other with Hurling Metal Argentina. \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n |"}, "no_ascii": 29, "archivo": "data/raw/myspace-ma-2026-10-15/14251-20090203150346.html", "foto_url": "http://c3.ac-images.myspacecdn.com/images01/86/m_0861212fe66d232c97babad275cddc92.jpg"}
{"ma_id": "17333", "banda": "Gore Asylum", "crv_artist_id": "796", "slug": "", "url": "", "archivo_org": "https://web.archive.org/web/20070815065417/https://myspace.com/goreasylum", "ok": true, "snapshot_ts": "20070815065417", "url_snapshot": "https://web.archive.org/web/20070815065417id_/https://myspace.com/goreasylum", "fuente": "ma", "bytes": 150638, "plantilla": "clasica", "titulo": "MySpace.com - GORE ASYLUM - Guayana, Bolivar - Death Metal / Grindcore / Black Metal  - www.myspace.com/goreasylum", "campos": {"Member Since": "1/22/2006", "Band Website": "goreasylum.com", "Band Members": "Sergio Ferreira - Vocal\n \n\nManuel Sarmiento - Bass\n \n\nWolfgang Rivas - Guitars\n \n\nMarlon Márquez - Drums", "Influences": "Suffocation, Malevolent Creation, Brutal Truth, Cannibal Corpse, Deicide, Napalm Death, Sinister, Gorgasm, Death, Morbid Angel, Dying Fetus, Slayer, Testament, Sodom, Sepultura, Cryptopsy, Nile, Hypocrisy, Hate Eternal, Kataklysm, Angelcorpse, Behemoth, Dark Funeral, Emperor, Lock up, Krisiun, Gorefest, Rotten Sound, and others... \n\n | | Try the BEST MySpace Editor at MySpace Toolbox !", "Sounds Like": "PARA PEDIDOS DE FRANELAS Y\nSWEATERS ENTRE AL WEB SITE: \nWWW.GOREASYLUM.COM\n \nENVIOS SOLO EN VENEZUELA", "Record Label": "Independent", "Type of Label": "None", "About": "La agrupación “Gore Asylum”, originaria de Puerto Ordaz (Edo. Bolívar) VENEZUELA, se establece a mediados del 2001. La banda fue fundada por Marlon Márquez (baterista) y Wolfgang Rivas (guitarrista). Después de algún tiempo de componer piezas se hizo necesario incluir a otros integrantes, fue entonces cuando entraron a la banda los hermanos Marco y Pedro Paz, que se desempeñaban como segunda guitarra y bajista. Ambos se acoplaron rápidamente a la banda. Luego de audicionar varios vocalistas se incorporó a las filas del grupo Sergio Ferreira. Por diferencias personales fue necesario remplazar a los hermanos Paz, es así cuando entran a la banda Manuel Sarmiento como bajista y Nelson Bravo en la segunda Guitarra ambos al igual que Marlon Márquez y Sergio Ferreira, son ex miembros de la extinta banda de Black Metal “Magan”. Cierto tiempo después es expulsado de la banda el Guitarrista Nelson Bravo. La banda se ha mantenido con 4 integrantes hasta la actualidad. Gore Asylum presentó al mercado en el 2003 su primer demo \"Into The Gore\", producido de manera independiente. Un pequeño trabajo que ofrece cinco temas de Brutal Death Metal, el cual ha tenido muy buenas críticas por parte del público metalero venezolano. Actualmente la banda se prepara para la grabación de su primer CD larga duración, que promete ser un excelente trabajo de Brutal Death Metal hecho en Venezuela.\n\n \n\nGORE ASYLUM Web Site: WWW.GOREASYLUM.COM\nEMAIL-CONTACTO MESSENGER: goreasylum@hotmail.com \nTelefono: 0058-04168866634 \nManager: Marlon Márquez. e-mail: marlonhm@hotmail.com\n\n \n\nLA BANDA GORE ASYLUM ESTA FINALIZANDO LAS SESIONES DE GRABACIÓN DE SU NUEVO DISCO LARGA DURACIÓN, ESTE REEMPLAZARA A SU ANTERIOR ÁLBUM “INTO THE GORE”. YA ESTÁN CULMINADAS LAS SESIONES DE BATERÍAS, GUITARRAS Y BAJO, SOLO FALTAN CULMINAR LAS SESIONES DE VOCES PARA PROSEGUIR CON LA MEZCLA Y MASTERIZACIÓN. \n\n \n\nEL NOMBRE DE ESTE DISCO NO ESTA DECIDIDO POR LOS MOMENTOS, PERO SERÁN 11 TEMAS DE BRUTAL DEATH METAL AL ESTILO QUE GORE ASYLUM SABE EJECUTAR. ESPERAMOS TERMINAR ESTE PROCESO PRONTO. MÁS INFORMACIÓN EN WWW.GOREASYLUM.COM\n\n \n\nPresentación de Gore ASylum Junto a Dying Fetus en la Sala Ana Julia Rojas del Ateneo de Caracas el 25 de Marzo del 2007. El tema: Vomiting my internal flesh. \n\n Gore Asylum - Vomiting my internal flesh (Live) | \n \n \n \n \n | Add to My Profile | More Videos \n\n \n\nEl tema: \"Impure Blood From A Virgin Cunt\" de Gore Asylumen vivo en la presentación Junto a Dying Fetus en la Sala Ana Julia Rojas del Ateneo de Caracas el 25 de Marzo del 2007. \n \n\n Gore Asylum - Impure Blood From a Virgin Cunt (Live) | \n \n \n \n \n | Add to My Profile | More Videos \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n |"}, "no_ascii": 54, "archivo": "data/raw/myspace-ma-2026-10-15/17333-20070815065417.html", "foto_url": "http://a293.ac-images.myspacecdn.com/00780/29/20/780320292_m.jpg"}
{"ma_id": "22870", "banda": "Sagoth", "crv_artist_id": "854", "slug": "", "url": "", "archivo_org": "https://web.archive.org/web/20081227193105/http://www.myspace.com/sagothhorde", "ok": true, "snapshot_ts": "20081227193105", "url_snapshot": "https://web.archive.org/web/20081227193105id_/http://www.myspace.com/sagothhorde", "fuente": "ma", "bytes": 168079, "plantilla": "clasica", "titulo": "MySpace.com - Sagoth  [Official] - Caracas, VE - Black Metal  - www.myspace.com/sagothhorde", "campos": {"Member Since": "4/24/2008", "Band Website": "sagoth-holocausto.tk", "Band Members": "Todos los derechos reservados bajo la ley.", "Influences": "Producciones \n \"Destrucción Masiva\" (demo) 2003 \n | \n\n \"Dominacion Imperial\" 2003 \n | \n\n \"Gloria Satanas\" 2005 (single) \n | \n\n \"Gloria Satanas\" 2005 (single) (Oskorei Bild Und Tonkunst, Version Alemania) \n | \n\n \"Glorificando La Oscuridad\" 2008 (Demo) \n | \n\n \"Southern Storm Of Evil\" (L.P. Compilado Black Metal Suramericano, Legion Of Death Records Francia) Con el tema \"LA SANGRE DEL ABORIGEN\" | \n | | \n\n \"Word of Black Metal\" (Compilado de Black Metal Suramericano desde Checoslovaquia\") Con el tema \"NISROC EMPEROR\" \n | |", "Sounds Like": "You've been marked on my visitor map! Click to zoom in. | \n \n | \nPagina Oficial de Sagoth |", "Record Label": "Legion Of Death Records", "Type of Label": "Major"}, "no_ascii": 54, "archivo": "data/raw/myspace-ma-2026-10-15/22870-20081227193105.html", "foto_url": "http://c4.ac-images.myspacecdn.com/images01/99/m_2cdfdaacb1aa2e0763a261a56c2ac283.jpg"}
