{"ma_id": "31551", "banda": "Necrofago", "crv_artist_id": "814", "slug": "", "url": "", "archivo_org": "https://web.archive.org/web/20101019124604/http://www.myspace.com/necrofagosvzla", "ok": true, "snapshot_ts": "20101019124604", "url_snapshot": "https://web.archive.org/web/20101019124604id_/http://www.myspace.com/necrofagosvzla", "fuente": "ma", "bytes": 145273, "plantilla": "clasica", "titulo": "NECROFAGOS on MySpace Music - Free Streaming MP3s, Pictures & Music Downloads", "campos": {"Member Since": "7/6/2009", "Band Members": "Joel Miranda (Voz)\n\nAli Miranda (Guitarra)\n\nAlberto Jiménez (Bajo)\n\nErnesto Hernández (Bateria)", "Influences": "Benediction, Napalm Death, Metallica, Malevolent Creation, Slayer, Kreator, Sepultura, Suffocation, Black Sabbath, Judas Priest, SS, Baphomet entre otros...", "Sounds Like": "NECROFAGOS\n \n\n ..\n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n\n.. Banda Necrofagos Caracas  |  Crea tu insignia | ..\n\n \n....\n..\nnew TWTR.Widget({\n version: 2,\n type: 'profile',\n rpp: 4,\n interval: 6000,\n width: 400,\n height: 300,\n theme: {\n shell: {\n background: '#333333',\n color: '#ffffff'\n },\n tweets: {\n background: '#000000',\n color: '#828082',\n links: '#7a060a'\n }\n },\n features: {\n scrollbar: false,\n loop: false,\n live: true,\n hashtags: true,\n timestamp: true,\n avatars: true,\n behavior: 'all'\n }\n}).render().setUser('necrofagos_vzla').start();\n..", "Record Label": "Independiente", "Type of Label": "Unsigned"}, "no_ascii": 25, "archivo": "data/raw/myspace-ma-2026-10-15/31551-20101019124604.html", "foto_url": "http://c1.ac-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/69/m_6b067c7a54284209b3597292b9851bd0.png"}
{"ma_id": "3540255454", "banda": "Regurgitorso", "crv_artist_id": null, "slug": "", "url": "", "archivo_org": "https://web.archive.org/web/20080117072456/https://myspace.com/regurgitorso", "ok": true, "snapshot_ts": "20080117072456", "url_snapshot": "https://web.archive.org/web/20080117072456id_/https://myspace.com/regurgitorso", "fuente": "ma", "bytes": 153319, "plantilla": "clasica", "titulo": "MySpace.com - Regurgitorso -  - Grindcore  - www.myspace.com/regurgitorso", "campos": {"Member Since": "4/26/2007", "Band Members": "Frank Burnatra - regurgivocals ;\nStubhaste Addelah - guitarizer ;\nRaul \"Crisped\" Ocha - basserizer ;\nMarcos Proud \"Fiele\" - drumsticks\n | \n |", "Influences": "The most extreme (musical and not musical) acts\n |", "Record Label": "Indie", "Type of Label": "None", "About": "Myspace Layouts at Pimp-My-Profile.com / - Image Hosting Regurgitorso band was founded in 2001 from Cross Any, ex vocalist of Cadaveric Stealer, and from the rythmic pair of Goat Enthronement. At the end of 2001 they know Addelah to a extreme-artists convention and they convince him to start playing guitar. After years passed in the most extreme undergroun, and without possibility of substaining the group, Cross Any decide to leave the band \"to search its own self\", while the vocals pass to Frank Burnatra (pseudonym of an artist never revealed from Regurgitorso, which on concerts is wearing a latex mask of Frank Sinatra)\n\nUntil today the band made several concerts in Venezuela, mostly ended in colossal brawls.\nThe only official product of the band is the self-produced EP titles \"Thy Kingdom of Darkness will be Overcummed\" which incorporates the typical brutal-grind-crossover elements of the band sound, pieces that like insane splinters assault the unprepared ear of the listener.\nCharacteristic shows of Regurgitorso show band members descend between the concert spectators to orchestrate mystic and apocryphal rituals. fibreglass hanks, bitumen, roaming gallineceans are permeating elements of live shows. The climax is reached when Regurgitorso band components at the end of the show point their faces to the public and auto-induce the vomit. Disgusting, but also extreme and direct, like the band sound.\n\nSound which has no technical expectation this one offered by 'Torsoes, but a pure sonic planer. After 'Torso... there's nothing.\n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n |"}, "no_ascii": 20, "archivo": "data/raw/myspace-ma-2026-10-15/3540255454-20080117072456.html", "foto_url": "http://a922.ac-images.myspacecdn.com/images01/5/m_b4cc94f7337ff2fc961941779bd2e281.gif"}
{"ma_id": "3540268655", "banda": "Nuclear Devastation", "crv_artist_id": "768", "slug": "", "url": "", "archivo_org": "https://web.archive.org/web/20090105063210/https://myspace.com/nxdthrashing", "ok": true, "snapshot_ts": "20090105063210", "url_snapshot": "https://web.archive.org/web/20090105063210id_/https://myspace.com/nxdthrashing", "fuente": "ma", "bytes": 179468, "plantilla": "clasica", "titulo": "MySpace.com - Nuclear Devastation - VE - Thrash / Metal  - www.myspace.com/nxdthrashing", "campos": {"Member Since": "10/6/2008", "Band Members": "Carlos Baterista, Angelo Bajo, Jorge Guitarra lider, Luilly Vocalista", "Influences": "Acid, Anthrax, Anthare, Assassin, At war, Artillery, Agent steel, Atrophy, Apocrypha, Agnostic front, Bulldozer, Bathrory,Celtic Frost Crumbsuckers, Cryptic Slaughter, Cranium, D.R.I, Dark angel, Death Angel, Darkness, Destruction, Devastation,Dead Kennedys Deathrow, Exciter, Evildead, Excel, Exodus, Exorcist, Exterminio, Exumer, Fatal Embrace, Grinder, Grim reaper, Gothic Slam, Heathen, Hellbastard, Hell's Kitchen, Hellhammer, Hirax, Hermetica, IRA, Iron maiden, Kreator, M.O.D, Macabre, Mega Mosh, Megadeth, Metallica, Morbid Angel, Morbid Said, Motorhead, Muro, Mecilles of death, Nuclear Assault, Natastor,Napalm Death, Obituary, Onslaught, Overkill, Rejectors, Ramones, Risk, Rumble Militia,Razor, Ratos de Porao, Soziedad Alcoholica, Sex Pistol Sacred Reich, Sacrifice, Sadus,Suicidal Tendencies, S.I.D, Sentinel Beast, Sepultura, Slaugther, Slayer, S.O.D, Saxon Sodom, Tankard, The Casualites, Testament, Tiniebla, Taurus, Vio-lence, Violence Force, Voivod, Venom, Vader, Whiplash, WarFare", "Sounds Like": "THrash Crossover muy pero muy cañero", "Type of Label": "Unsigned", "About": "Nuclear Devastation nace en una tarde calurosa de abril del 2008 en los valles del tuy con tan solo 3 integrantes con ganas de hacer un buen thrash metal con los meses se la banda ha mesclado un poco del mejor crossover ochentero con temas muy veloz, el 5 de octubre NxD entra por primera vez en estudio para grabar 3 pequeños temas que no incluyen voz, para el publico que se encuentra presente en la movida underground se diera a conocer, en busquedad de vocalista ese mismo mes ingresa una mujer pero dura poco en la banda y estaria en el mando de la voz jorge el guitarra lider de la banda, en noviembre del 2008 nuclear devastation entra en accion dando una pequeña presentacion en charallave entre gente conocida y demas, a finales del mes entra un nuevo vocalista de nombre luiyi que ahora pertenece a la familia de nuclear devastation...\nNuclear Devastation somo una banda de thrash metal con el fin de hacer el mejor thrash y crossover ochentero en la ecena venezolana se le agradece a todos aquellos pana que nos prestado su apoyo.. Venezuela una movida de azotes atacadores \nThrash ATTACK\n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n tv layout powered by HOT FreeLayouts.com / MyHotComments \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n |"}, "no_ascii": 46, "archivo": "data/raw/myspace-ma-2026-10-15/3540268655-20090105063210.html", "foto_url": "http://c1.ac-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/16/m_5992b945626a44308fb5c3910bbb579c.jpg"}
{"ma_id": "3540269197", "banda": "Oldskull", "crv_artist_id": "749", "slug": "", "url": "", "archivo_org": "https://web.archive.org/web/20090216071756/https://myspace.com/oldskullthrash", "ok": true, "snapshot_ts": "20090216071756", "url_snapshot": "https://web.archive.org/web/20090216071756id_/https://myspace.com/oldskullthrash", "fuente": "ma", "bytes": 193849, "plantilla": "clasica", "titulo": "oldskull on MySpace Music - Free Streaming MP3s, Pictures & Music Downloads", "campos": {"Member Since": "7/28/2008", "Band Members": "OLDSKULL_BAND@HOTMAIL.COM\n\ncontacto 58-0412-4478817 __________________________________________________\n\n \n \n\nROBERTO ANDERSEN -(GUITARRISTA -VOCAL)__________________________________________________\n\n \n\n \n\nCARLOS AGUIRRE- (BATERIA)__________________________________________________\n\n \n\n \n\nGABRIEL BURLAND ( BAJO ) \"peluso\"\n__________________________________________________", "Influences": "influencias: tinieblas,nemesis,kreator,exodus,,sodom,slayer,tankard,sadus, algo de bandas como bulldozer, sabbat, bathory, venom , necronomicon y muchos mas .", "Sounds Like": "CD1: http://www.mediafire.com/?trkw2zzvywm \n\nCD2: http://www.mediafire.com/?iy3vyuuqzmt \n_____________________________________\n\n \n\nPARA BAJAR LOS TEMAS CLICK EN ESTE LINK > http://www.mediafire.com/?9k9gxz9ekkg \n\n_____________________________________\n\n \n\n_____________________________________\n\n \n\nvisitors desde 28/01/2009", "Record Label": "Sin contrato discográfico", "Type of Label": "Unsigned", "About": "Myspace Layouts at Pimp-My-Profile.com / Skeleton \n\n \n Roberto Andersen guitarrista empeso a tocar junto a Carlos Aguirre actual baterista buscando que en algun momento, luego de mucha practica se pudiese formar un proyecto nuevo, luego se comenso con la idea de una banda thrash, por ser la influencia principal. luego , ya contando con practica y un repertorio de temas compuestos comiensan en busca de otros integrantes. Roberto conoce a Gabriel Burland bajista de predator en un evento de thrash metal y se le propone entrar en el proyecto, burland acepta formar parte del proyecto y comienzan a ensayar el repertorio. Entre junio y julio de ese año nace la banda OLDSKULL nombre colocado por Roberto el lider de la banda por un juego de palabras entre lo que se denota como la vieja escuela del thrash que les influencia y ese toque macabro de los temas y es formada como “power trio” en valencia .\nSus integrantes son:\nRoberto Briceño Andersen (guitarra y voz) (ex miembro de hodur y de predator)\nCarlos Aguirre(bateria) (ex-hodur)\nGabriel Burland (Bajo) (ex Predator) \n\nInfluencia: a lo que es el thrash black e inspirado en los inicios del thrash europeo como kreator, sodom, destruction, vendetta y algo de bandas como bulldozer, sabbat, bathory y venom.\n\n \n \n \n \n \n____________________________________\n\n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n |"}, "no_ascii": 81, "archivo": "data/raw/myspace-ma-2026-10-15/3540269197-20090216071756.html", "foto_url": "http://c3.ac-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/62/m_068fe50c2acc43b5a435abde3801d0ee.jpg"}
{"ma_id": "3540308025", "banda": "Brutal Destripation", "crv_artist_id": "464", "slug": "", "url": "", "archivo_org": "https://web.archive.org/web/20101111053226/https://myspace.com/brutaldestripation", "ok": true, "snapshot_ts": "20101111053226", "url_snapshot": "https://web.archive.org/web/20101111053226id_/https://myspace.com/brutaldestripation", "fuente": "ma", "bytes": 145976, "plantilla": "clasica", "titulo": "BRUTAL DESTRIPATION (OFFICIAL) on Myspace Music - Free Streaming MP3s, Pictures & Music Downloads", "campos": {"Member Since": "9/26/2008", "Band Members": "| \n\n \n | \n\n \n | \n\n \n | \n\n \n | \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n | \n\n \n | \n\n \n | \n\n \n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n | \n\n \n \n \n\n \n | \n\n \n | \n\n \n | \n\n \n | \n\n \n | \n\n \n | \n\n \n | \n\n \n | \n\n \n | \n\n \n | \n\n \n | \n\n \n |", "Type of Label": "Unsigned", "About": "| \n\n \n \n \n | \n\n \n \n \n | \n\n \n \n \n | \n\n \n \n \n | \n\n \n \n \n | \n\n \n \n \n | \n\n \n \n \n | \n\n \n \n \n | \n\n | \n | | | \n\n | \n | | | \n\n \n \n \n\n | \n | \n \n \n \n | \n\n \n\n | \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n |"}, "no_ascii": 66, "archivo": "data/raw/myspace-ma-2026-10-15/3540308025-20101111053226.html", "foto_url": "http://c1.ac-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/128/m_86b8e0c8fa674e768d50b278d9980d58.gif"}
{"ma_id": "3540315602", "banda": "Human", "crv_artist_id": "304", "slug": "", "url": "", "archivo_org": "https://web.archive.org/web/20081009085057/https://myspace.com/humanrock", "ok": true, "snapshot_ts": "20081009085057", "url_snapshot": "https://web.archive.org/web/20081009085057id_/https://myspace.com/humanrock", "fuente": "ma", "bytes": 161587, "plantilla": "clasica", "titulo": "MySpace.com - HUMAN - Caracas, Miranda - Death Metal / Metal  - www.myspace.com/humanrock", "campos": {"Member Since": "4/15/2006", "Band Members": "Leonardo Martinez (Vocals) \n \n \n Ericksen Lezama (Lead/Rhythm Guitar) \n \n \n Brayan Arias (Drums) \n \n \n Henry Infante (Lead/Rhythm Guitar) \n \n \n Nelson Gonzalez (Bass)", "Influences": "In Flames, Arch Enemy, Dark Tranquillity, Hypocrisy, Soilwork, Children of Bodom. (Mostly Melodic Death Metal)", "Type of Label": "None", "About": "Ericksen Lezama (Guitar) and Henry Infante (Guitar), a couple of years ago, started playing Hypocrisy and In Flames' songs, they thought they were doing a pretty good job, so they talked to a friend of Ericksen's (Oliver) and he decided to practice with them as a drummer; back then, they didn't have any bass player on mind. Henry's ex-bandmate (Nelson Gonzales) was called and he accepted to be part of the project as bass player. Now, the band was complete...ALMOST... | | \n\nAlthough We didn't have a Vocalist, we started to practice in a Studio in Caracas-Venezuela, covering songs of Hypocrisy, In Flames, among others. Weeks after that, Ericksen's brother (Leonardo) was invited to the studio, he was part of another project as Vocalist but Ericksen always wanted to play with his oldest brother, so Ericksen shows him every song and all the lyrics in order to convince him to join HUMAN. Leonardo was amazed with their job, he recommended him to write their own lyrics and music; Leonardo weeks after joined the band as a Vocalist with new song and a great spirit starving of Metal. | | \n\nOne year after, Oliver left the band for personal reasons and Daniel Patino took his place on the Drums. \n\n | | This year 2008, Human is looking for a record label in Venezuela; writing more songs and making good music as you can tell. \n\n | | Thanks for your appreciation, and leave a comment... \n\n real editor best profile tools \n \n \n \n \n \n \n |"}, "no_ascii": 30, "archivo": "data/raw/myspace-ma-2026-10-15/3540315602-20081009085057.html", "foto_url": "http://c2.ac-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/3/m_3a1fdf1d5aab4ecf953a66730269c21d.jpg"}
{"ma_id": "3540493361", "banda": "Rotten in Life", "crv_artist_id": null, "slug": "", "url": "", "archivo_org": "https://web.archive.org/web/20100425021055/http://www.myspace.com/RottenInLife", "ok": true, "snapshot_ts": "20100425021055", "url_snapshot": "https://web.archive.org/web/20100425021055id_/http://www.myspace.com/RottenInLife", "fuente": "ma", "bytes": 117422, "plantilla": "clasica", "titulo": "Rotten In Life on MySpace Music - Free Streaming MP3s, Pictures & Music Downloads", "campos": {"Member Since": "7/9/2009", "Band Members": "| | \n\n | | \n\n | | \n\n | | \n\n | | \n\n | |", "Influences": "Death Metal enfocado en liricas Gore\nmarcando putrefaccion y sangre en temas\nque abarcan los instintos humanos mas grotescos,\npodridos, oscuros y perturbadores \n\n | | | \n\n \n\n \n\nYa esta disponible el DVD | \n \"DESMEMBRAMIENTOS INHUMANOS DEL MAESTRO\" | \nadquierelo en Cannibal Records Barinas o contactanos para envios nacionales.\n | | \n\n \n | | \n\n | | \n\n \n | |", "Type of Label": "Unsigned", "About": "| | | | | | | | | | | | | | | \n\n \n\n \n \n\n \n \n | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | | \n \n \n \n\n | | \n\n \"CARPINTERIA HUMANA\" | Video Oficial | | \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n | | \n\n \"ROTTEN\" | Debut en el colegio de abogados de Barinas abriendo la gira Crisis Comienzo del Fin | | \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n | | \n\n DESCARGA NUESTRO DEMO YA EN http://www.megashare.com/1257848 | | \n\n | | \n | | \n\n \n\n | \n\n ROTTEN IN LIFE (PODRIDO EN VIDA) | | \n\n \nComienza sus orígenes a finales del año 2007, integrado por su vocalista Lord Cannibal (David) quien en compañía del guitarrista y bajista Emilio y Leandro da inicio al proyecto, luego de unos meses de práctica los tres deciden que entre en la batería un viejo amigo, Jonás. Tras algunos ensayos, el guitarrista Emilio deja la formación por motivos de trabajo, es allí cuando Leandro toma la decisión de abandonar el bajo dentro de la banda y tomar el trabajo en las seis cuerdas a su responsabilidad. Pasado algunos meses la banda empieza a tomar forma con la incorporación de Lord Panzer (Daniel) como bajista y ayuda en la joven agrupación, así mismo, como la llegada del guitarrista Havokill, quienes se preparan a crear temas fuertes para la banda, pero tras una pequeña presentación en un pequeño toque, el bajista Daniel y el guitarrista Havokill abandonan la banda, al casi mismo tiempo ocurre la expulsión del baterista Jonás, por decisión unánime. | | \n\nEs allí cuando el camino de los Rotten parecía llegar a su final, pero toman un pequeño aliento al conseguir para el trabajo de las cuatro cuerdas al bajista Lord Blood (Romer) quien se incorpora a la banda de forma sólida y decisiva llegando a convertirse hoy día en la segunda voz de mando dentro de la banda, tras unos meses de ensayo entra en la banda el baterista Lord Death (Denny) para conformar lo que se esperaba fuera la formación final de Rotten in Life. | | \n\nPero los problemas y obstáculos para el joven proyecto death metalero aun no terminaban, tras no tener un lugar fijo para ensayar y por falta de algunos instrumentos como la batería, empiezan a surgir pequeños mal entendidos entre la banda, llegando de este modo a dar grandes diferencias del guitarrista Leandro en contra del vocalista Lord Cannibal, dando como resultado la salida inmediata de este sin importar sus orígenes en la formación podrida. | | \n\nUna ves mas los Rotten encontraban una pared muerta en su camino, pero fue allí cuando cobraron una nueva oscuridad llena de sangre cuando sin esperarse y de forma casi instantánea a la salida de su ex guitarrista llega a la banda Lord Mortem (Juan, conocido como Sacred) para dar un nuevo sonido y potencia a la banda que aun no habían logrado tener por falta de buenas ideas y riff. | | \n\nDe esta forma Rotten In Life se estableció como banda y se preparo a engendrar una nueva generación de matanza y patología en la madre tierra del llano Barines. | | | | \n\n | | \n\n \n\n | | \n \n\n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n |"}, "no_ascii": 49, "archivo": "data/raw/myspace-ma-2026-10-15/3540493361-20100425021055.html", "foto_url": "http://c1.ac-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/93/m_e09383f13b5b40e697c737d1f0b84798.jpg"}
{"ma_id": "3540494982", "banda": "Sol Nocturno", "crv_artist_id": "870", "slug": "", "url": "", "archivo_org": "https://web.archive.org/web/20090913071015/https://myspace.com/solnocturnomusic", "ok": true, "snapshot_ts": "20090913071015", "url_snapshot": "https://web.archive.org/web/20090913071015id_/https://myspace.com/solnocturnomusic", "fuente": "ma", "bytes": 116075, "plantilla": "clasica", "titulo": "Sol Nocturno (ex Gorepriest) on MySpace Music - Free Streaming MP3s, Pictures & Music Downloads", "campos": {"Member Since": "6/8/2009", "Band Website": "gorepriest.tk", "Type of Label": "Unsigned", "About": "| \n | \n | \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n | \n | \n | \n | \n \n Caos Cósmico (2009, Por Anunciar / TBA) \n Como GOREPRIEST / As GOREPRIEST: \n \n \n | \n \n \n Thanatologica (2009, Independiente) | \n Perpetual Horizons (2005, VeNet) | \n War Against Humanity (2003, Melomaniac) | \n Beneath Eternal Oceans Of Melancholy (2002, Demo) \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n De las cenizas del abandonado proyecto GOREPRIEST, Federico Agreda nos trae un nuevo y poderoso ritual bajo el nombre de SOL NOCTURNO, la representación de la dualidad humana, el cosmos y el caos convergidos en un solo ser, y cierta referencia sarcástica al sistema actual y la próxima llegada de Nibiru. \"Caos Cósmico\" es una obra completamente compuesta en español e integra sonidos latinoamericanos y venezolanos con el Black Metal, hecho exclusivamente con sintetizadores y secuenciadores, siguiendo el legado del Sacerdote del Gore. \n From the ashes of abandoned project GOREPRIEST, Federico Agreda brings a new and powerful ritual under the name of SOL NOCTURNO (Nocturnal Sun), the depiction of human duality, cosmos and chaos converged in one single being, and a certain sarcastic reference to the current system and the next coming of Nibiru. \"Caos Cósmico\" (Cosmic Chaos) is a masterpiece completely composed in spanish and integrates native latinamerican and venezuelan sounds with Black Metal, made exclusively with synthesizers and sequencers, following the legacy of the Gore Priest. \n \n \n \n \n | \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 15 Weeks | \n Blackkjack | \n Demise |\n Ecliptic |\n Epitafio |\n Mirrorthrone |\n Ninth Kingdom | \n Noctis \n Imperium | \n Psicosis | \n Puah | \n Sea Of Nectar |\n Sermon Of Hypocrisy | \n Serpent Christ |\n Spellforest |\n Tenghel \n | Veldraveth | \n Verminous \n \n \n \n Help |\n Terms \n | \n Privacy Policy |\n \n Safety Tips | \n Block User |\n \n Report Abuse |\n \n Advertise | Developers |\n \n MySpace International | MySpace \n Latino \n \n \n\n \n\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n |"}, "no_ascii": 20, "archivo": "data/raw/myspace-ma-2026-10-15/3540494982-20090913071015.html", "foto_url": "http://c4.ac-images.myspacecdn.com/images02/98/m_e0d090d5b9a0444098e8542cc4b7d17f.jpg"}
